{"title":"2025 SSMO Speed Round Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce16be4c484b7e04b45e4643012c8b1e9310f95.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = \\begin{cases} x + 2 &amp; \\text{if } x &lt; 0 \\\\ x^2 + 1 &amp; \\text{if } x \\geq 0 \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"53\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e412c077225797c18ae814ace442098339d8c83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"17\" />. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a4614c40f4ceca296b3d80ac1389ed723f71cb37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{n+1} = f(x_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />. Find the least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf379f14790b8c056d16fad9cf4df2fb2f6bf5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n &gt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute the first few values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195db3e04ee69d85a0aeaedbb1cf9afa97ff4546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />:\n\\begin{align*}\nx_0 &amp;= -3 \\\\\nx_1 &amp;= f(-3) = -1 \\\\\nx_2 &amp;= f(-1) = 1 \\\\\nx_3 &amp;= f(1) = 2 \\\\\nx_4 &amp;= f(2) = 5 \\\\\nx_5 &amp;= f(5) = 26 \\\\\nx_6 &amp;= f(26) = 677.\n\\end{align*}\nThus, the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c596c838a5e20c3371b0e3ce170b93d301b1294.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n&gt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb760a2c7143780db481b394ada34e0bb23b3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Sedro\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017142730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1673/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:33781:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017142730 and revision id 260124. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}